# An `emit` against a node cap: `93_emit_node` adds a rule matching the
# emitted Alarm, whose alpha (node 6) is capped at 1, so the second of two
# Alarms has nowhere to go. `wm_max` is generous, so it does not refuse the
# assert first. Realtime-only: its MANIFEST row is commented out.
assert Zone name=a threshold=10.0
assert Reading entity_id=r1 zone=a state=35.0
pump
assert Reading entity_id=r2 zone=a state=36.0
pump
